linux-webauthn (0.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian package for the Linux WebAuthn authenticator.
  * Install the user-session systemd service, D-Bus service, and UHID udev rule.
  * Preserve automatic startup of the authenticator in the logged-in user session.

